N
$$

**subject to**

$$
x_{A1} + x_{A2} + x_{A3} \leq 100 
\quad (\text{workshop A hours})
$$

$$
x_{B1} + x_{B2} + x_{B3} \leq 150 
\quad (\text{workshop B hours})
